{"type":"message","id":"44d12206","parentId":"35201da7","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:07:51.080Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 16:07 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: ParMETIS 算法优化 - P0 问题修复\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n\n## Context\n优化 ParMETIS 网格分割算法的效率与内存占用。这是第一轮优化，专注 P0 必须修复的问题。\n\n## Requirements\n\n### P0-1: 修复 `distribute()` 负载均衡问题\n\n**位置:** `src/metisCutter.cpp` L17-24\n\n**当前问题:**\n```cpp\nauto step = (len + n - 1) / n;  // 向上取整\nnCellThisRank = MPIAdapter::isLast() ? len - (n - 1) * step : step;\n```\n向上取整导致最后一个进程分配的元素很少（甚至可能为0或负数），造成负载不均衡。\n\n**修复方案:**\n使用向下取整 + 余数均匀分配策略：\n```cpp\nauto base = len / n;  // 基础分配\nauto remainder = len % n;  // 余数\n// 前 remainder 个进程分配 base+1 个，其余分配 base 个\n```\n\n### P0-2: 重构 Interface 通信模式\n\n**位置:** `src/metisCutter.cpp` L84-113 `collect_interface()`\n\n**当前问题:**\n- 使用 `MPI_Alltoallv` 全量广播，通信开销 O(SIZE²)\n- 每个进程都向所有其他进程发送完整 interface 数据\n- 字符串序列化效率低\n\n**优化方案:**\n1. **稀疏通信**: 只与有实际 interface 共享的进程通信\n2. **二进制序列化**: 替代字符串序列化\n3. **点对点通信**: 使用 `MPI_Isend/MPI_Irecv` 替代 `MPI_Alltoallv`\n\n**实现思路:**\n```cpp\n// 1. 收集需要通信的目标进程列表\nset<int> targetRanks;\nfor (const auto& [nbrFile, faces] : outerFace_) {\n    if (!faces.empty() && ownerThread_.count(nbrFile)) {\n        targetRanks.insert(ownerThread_[nbrFile]);\n    }\n}\n\n// 2. 先交换目标进程列表\nvector<int> allTargets;\n// ... MPI_Allgatherv 收集所有目标\n\n// 3. 只与目标进程进行点对点通信\n// 4. 使用二进制格式序列化\n```\n\n### P1-3: Interface 数据结构优化 (如果时间允许)\n\n**位置:** `src/metisCutter.h` L39\n\n**当前问题:**\n```cpp\nunordered_map<int, map<string, vector<cgsize_t>>> outerFace_;\n```\n字符串作为 key，内存和比较效率低。\n\n**优化方案:**\n使用哈希值替代字符串：\n```cpp\n// 定义面哈希函数\nsize_t hashFace(const vector<cgsize_t>& face) {\n    size_t h = 0;\n    for (auto id : face) h ^= hash<cgsize_t>{}(id) + 0x9e3779b9 + (h << 6) + (h >> 2);\n    return h;\n}\n// 使用 unordered_map<size_t, vector<cgsize_t>>\n```\n\n## Deliverable\n\n1. 修复后的 `src/metisCutter.cpp` 和 `src/metisCutter.h`\n2. 代码能够编译通过\n3. 保持原有功能不变\n\n## 测试环境设置\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nsource ../env.sh\nexport PATH=$MPI_ROOT/bin:$PATH\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$CGNS_ROOT/lib:$METIS_ROOT/lib:$PARMETIS_ROOT/lib:$MPI_ROOT/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n```\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772611671078}}
{"type":"message","id":"599ff23b","parentId":"44d12206","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:08:02.016Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand the task:\n\n1. I need to fix P0 issues in ParMETIS algorithm optimization\n2. Workspace is `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n3. Two main P0 issues to fix:\n   - P0-1: Fix `distribute()` load balancing issue in `src/metisCutter.cpp` L17-24\n   - P0-2: Refactor Interface communication pattern in `src/metisCutter.cpp` L84-113 `collect_interface()`\n4. P1-3 is optional if time allows\n\nLet me start by reading the current code to understand the implementation.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll start by reading the current implementation to understand the code structure and then implement the P0 fixes."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-c91be77bc5db4ffb8fdd7e2b5fbe7818","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-0d06a60660074623962926d9f5cdd18d","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.h"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":10001,"output":337,"cacheRead":3423,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13761,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772611671080}}
{"type":"message","id":"394b2e4b","parentId":"599ff23b","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:08:02.021Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-c91be77bc5db4ffb8fdd7e2b5fbe7818","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#include <algorithm>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <cstring>\n#include <ctime>\n#include <numeric>\n\n#include <cgns_io.h>\n#include <parmetis.h>\n\n#include \"cmdLine.h\"\n#include \"metisCutter.h\"\n#include \"mpiAdapter.h\"\n#include \"stringUtil.h\"\n\nstatic const int DataTAG = 1000;\n\nstatic std::vector<idx_t> distribute(const idx_t len, const int n, idx_t &nCellThisRank)\n{\n    vector<idx_t> dist(n + 1, 0);\n    auto step = (len + n - 1) / n;\n    nCellThisRank = MPIAdapter::isLast() ? len - (n - 1) * step : step;\n    MPI_Allgather(&nCellThisRank, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), dist.data() + 1, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (int iProc = 1; iProc < n + 1; ++iProc) { dist[iProc] += dist[iProc - 1]; }\n    return dist;\n}\n\nnamespace MeshCut\n{\nMetisCutter::MetisCutter() : bigMesh_(nullptr) {}\n\nMetisCutter::~MetisCutter() {}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut(int argc, char **argv)\n{\n    CmdLine cl{};\n    cl.regist<std::string, CmdLine::MustOffer>(\"m\", \"mesh\", \"mesh file name.\", \" \");\n    cl.regist<size_t, CmdLine::MustOffer>(\"np\", \"npart\", \"part number of sub-mesh.\", \" \");\n    cl.parse(argc, argv);\n\n    MPIAdapter::Initialize(&argc, &argv);\n#ifdef DEBUG_MODE\n    if (!MPIAdapter::isParallel() || (MPIAdapter::isParallel() && MPIAdapter::isMaster()))\n    {\n        std::cout << \"DEBUG_MODE: type any char to continue\\n\";\n        auto a = std::getchar();\n    }\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n#endif\n    MPIAdapter::isParallel() ? this->cut_parmetis(cl.get<std::string>(\"mesh\"), cl.get<size_t>(\"npart\")) : this->cut_metis(cl.get<std::string>(\"mesh\"), cl.get<size_t>(\"npart\"));\n}\n\n// collect interface from all other threads\nvoid MetisCutter::collect_interface()\n{\n    auto packInterface = [&, this]() -> std::string\n    {\n        std::string sendStr;\n        for (auto ifile : outerFace_)\n        {\n            if (ifile.second.empty()) continue;\n\n            sendStr += (std::to_string(ifile.first) + \":\");\n            for (auto face : ifile.second) { sendStr += (face.first + \";\"); }\n            sendStr += \"#\";\n        }\n\n        return sendStr;\n    };\n\n    auto unpackInterface = [&, this](const string &recvStr)\n    {\n        for (auto ifile : stringSplit(recvStr, \"#\"))\n        {\n            auto cur = stringSplit(ifile, \":\");\n            auto nbrFile = std::stoi(cur[0]);\n            if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) continue;\n\n            check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %d interface of file %d\\n\", RANK, stringSplit(cur[1], \";\").size(), nbrFile));\n\n            auto &nbrOuterface = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n            for (auto face : stringSplit(cur[1], \";\")) { nbrOuterface.insert({face, {}}); }\n        }\n    };\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    string sendTmp = packInterface(), recvStr, sendStr;\n    int sendCnt = sendTmp.size();\n    vector<int> sendCnts(SIZE, sendCnt), sdisp(SIZE, 0), rdisp(SIZE, 0), recvCnt(SIZE, 0);\n\n    MPI_Alltoall(sendCnts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, recvCnt.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (auto i = 1; i < SIZE; ++i) rdisp[i] = rdisp[i - 1] + recvCnt[i - 1];\n    recvStr.assign(std::accumulate(recvCnt.begin(), recvCnt.end(), 0) + 1, ' ');\n    for (auto i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) sendStr += sendTmp;\n    for (auto i = 1; i < SIZE; ++i) sdisp[i] = sdisp[i - 1] + sendCnt;\n    MPI_Alltoallv(sendStr.data(), sendCnts.data(), sdisp.data(), MPI_CHAR, (char *)(recvStr.data()), recvCnt.data(), rdisp.data(), MPI_CHAR, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n    unpackInterface(stringTrim(recvStr));\n}\n\n// collect cell id from all other threads\nvector<MetisCutter::Cell> MetisCutter::collect_subBody(const MetisCutter::DecomposeResult &decomposeResult, const vector<int> &ownerThread)\n{\n    map<int, vector<Cell>> cellInfo;\n    {\n        for (idx_t i = 0; i < decomposeResult.nCellThisRank; ++i)\n        {\n            int partId = cellPartition_[i];\n            auto threadId = ownerThread[partId];\n            auto cellId = decomposeResult.start + i;\n            cellInfo[threadId].push_back(Cell{cellId, partId});\n        }\n    }\n    vector<idx_t>{}.swap(cellPartition_); // free\n\n    // all process collect send-recv info from all process\n    vector<long> sendInfo(SIZE, 0), recvInfo(SIZE, 0);\n    {\n        for (auto it : cellInfo)\n        {\n            if (it.first != RANK) sendInfo[it.first] += it.second.size();\n        }\n        MPI_Alltoall(sendInfo.data(), 1, MPI_LONG, recvInfo.data(), 1, MPI_LONG, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    }\n\n    // send-recv data\n    MPI_Datatype cellType;\n    {\n        const int cnt = 2;\n        int blockLen[cnt] = {1, 1};\n        MPI_Aint disp[cnt] = {0, sizeof(idx_t)};\n        MPI_Datatype types[cnt] = {MPI_LONG, MPI_INT};\n        MPIAdapter::TypeStruct(cnt, blockLen, disp, types, &cellType);\n        MPIAdapter::TypeCommit(&cellType);\n    }\n    vector<MPI_Request> requests;\n    vector<MPI_Status> statuses;\n    vector<vector<Cell>> recvData;\n    // send\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i)\n    {\n        if (sendInfo[i] != 0)\n        {\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPIAdapter::ISend(cellInfo[i].data(), cellInfo[i].size(), cellType, i, DataTAG + i, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n    // recv\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i)\n    {\n        auto recvDataSize = recvInfo[i];\n        if (recvDataSize != 0)\n        {\n            recvData.push_back(vector<Cell>(recvDataSize, Cell{}));\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Irecv(recvData.back().data(), recvDataSize, cellType, i, RANK + DataTAG, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &(requests.back()));\n        }\n    }\n    statuses.assign(requests.size(), MPI_Status{});\n    MPIAdapter::WaitAll(requests.size(), requests.data(), statuses.data());\n    requests.clear(), statuses.clear();\n\n    // update cellInfo\n    for (auto &it : recvData)\n    {\n        for (auto &jt : it) cellInfo[RANK].emplace_back(jt);\n    }\n    MPIAdapter::TypeFree(&cellType);\n\n    return cellInfo[RANK];\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut_metis(string meshFilename, const int np)\n{\n    // open mesh file to read/write\n    bigMesh_ = std::make_shared<CGFile>(meshFilename);\n    this->updateOwnerThread(meshFilename, np);\n\n    // load body-data into memory from file\n    auto bigBody = bigMesh_->loadSection(bigMesh_->bodySectionIdList());\n\n    check(true, \"\", format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s\\n\", bigBody.name));\n    // cut\n    check(cut_metis(bigBody.data, (idx_t)np, cellPartition_, nodePartition_) == METIS_OK, format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s return error %s\", bigBody.name), format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s successfuly\\n\", bigBody.name));\n\n    // write sub-mesh data to file\n    for (auto ifile = 0; ifile < np; ++ifile)\n    {\n        // open sub-mesh to write\n        this->openSubMeshToWrite(meshFilename, ifile, np);\n\n        // collect cell/node id of sub-mesh\n        nodeIdG2L_.insert({ifile, {}}); // 1-base id\n        nodeIds_.clear();               // 1-base id\n        cellIds_.clear();               // 0-base id\n        for (auto i = 0; i < cellPartition_.size(); ++i)\n        {\n            if (cellPartition_[i] != ifile) continue;\n\n            cellIds_.insert(i + 1);\n            for (auto it : bigBody.cell(i + 1))\n                if (nodeIds_.count(it) == 0) nodeIds_.insert(it);\n        }\n        for (auto it : nodeIds_) nodeIdG2L_[ifile].insert({it, nodeIdG2L_[ifile].size() + 1});\n\n        // write coordinate\n        this->rwNode(ifile);\n\n        // write body-section\n        this->rwBody(ifile, bigBody);\n\n        // write bdy-section\n        this->rwBoundary(ifile);\n\n        // write interface\n        this->rwInterface(ifile);\n\n        // clear\n        for (auto i = 0; i <= ifile; ++i)\n        {\n            if (outerFace_[i].empty())\n            {\n                nodeIdG2L_[i].clear();\n                smallMesh_[i]->close();\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // clear\n    bigMesh_->close();\n    bigBody.clear();\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut_parmetis(string meshFilename, const int np)\n{\n    RANK = MPIAdapter::rank(), SIZE = MPIAdapter::size();\n\n    if (SIZE > np)\n    {\n        if (MPIAdapter::isMaster()) check(true, \"\", format(\"MPI size should not bigger than subMesh number: %d > %d\\n\", SIZE, np));\n\n        MPIAdapter::Finalize();\n        exit(EXIT_SUCCESS);\n    }\n\n    // open mesh file to read/write\n    bigMesh_ = std::make_shared<CGFile>(meshFilename);\n    this->updateOwnerThread(meshFilename, np);\n\n    // handle bodysection\n    auto bigBody = bigMesh_->bodySection();\n\n    // decompose body-section into np parts,\n    // and collect subBody belong to each process\n    auto comPartId = [](const Cell &lhs, const Cell &rhs) { return lhs.partId < rhs.partId; };\n    auto comId = [](const Cell &lhs, const Cell &rhs) { return lhs.id < rhs.id; };\n    auto subBody = collect_subBody(this->decompose_body(bigBody, np), ownerThread_);\n    if (subBody.size() == 0) std::cout << format(\"Thread %d has no subBody\\n\", RANK);\n    std::sort(subBody.begin(), subBody.end(), comPartId);\n    auto pos = subBody.begin();\n    while (pos != subBody.end())\n    {\n        // relod body-section\n        auto lastPos = pos;\n        const auto ifile = lastPos->partId;\n        pos = std::upper_bound(lastPos, subBody.end(), *lastPos, comPartId);\n        std::sort(lastPos, pos, comId);\n        auto indexLB = lastPos->id, indexUB = (pos - 1)->id;\n        auto curBody = bigMesh_->loadSection(bigMesh_->bodySectionIdList(), indexLB, indexUB);\n        // check(true, \"\", format(\"  Thread %d: load %d cells [%d-%d] of part %d\\n\", RANK, indexUB-indexLB+1, indexLB, indexUB, ifile));\n\n        // open sub-mesh file for writing (CRITICAL: must be done before rwNode/rwBody)\n        this->openSubMeshToWrite(meshFilename, ifile, np);\n\n        // cell and node\n        cellIds_.clear(), nodeIds_.clear();\n        for (auto cell : subBody)\n        {\n            if (cell.partId != ifile) continue;\n            cellIds_.insert(cell.id);\n            for (auto it : curBody.cell(cell.id))\n                if (nodeIds_.count(it) == 0) nodeIds_.insert(it);\n        }\n        nodeIdG2L_.insert({ifile, {}});\n        if (!nodeIds_.empty())\n            for (auto it : nodeIds_) nodeIdG2L_[ifile].insert({it, nodeIdG2L_[ifile].size() + 1});\n\n        // write coordinate\n        this->rwNode(ifile);\n\n        // write body\n        this->rwBody(ifile, curBody);\n\n        // write bdy\n        this->rwBoundary(ifile);\n    }\n    bigBody.clear();\n\n    // collect interface\n    this->collect_interface();\n\n    // write interface\n    for (auto ifile : ownerFile_) this->writeInterface(ifile, np);\n\n    // clear\n    bigMesh_->close();\n    for (auto it : smallMesh_)\n        if (it != nullptr) it->close();\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n}\n\nint MetisCutter::cut_metis(const vector<vector<idx_t>> &cellToplogy, idx_t np, vector<idx_t> &cellPartition, vector<idx_t> &nodePartition)\n{\n    // metis options\n    idx_t options[METIS_NOPTIONS];\n    options[METIS_OPTION_PTYPE] = METIS_PTYPE_KWAY;\n    options[METIS_OPTION_OBJTYPE] = METIS_OBJTYPE_CUT;\n    options[METIS_OPTION_NUMBERING] = 0;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_CTYPE] = METIS_CTYPE_SHEM;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_IPTYPE] = METIS_IPTYPE_EDGE;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_RTYPE] = METIS_RTYPE_GREEDY;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_NCUTS] = 1;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_NITER] = 10;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_UFACTOR] = 30;\n    METIS_SetDefaultOptions(options);\n\n    // eind-eptr\n    std::vector<idx_t> eind, eptr(cellToplogy.size() + 1, 0);\n    cgsize_t offset = 0;\n    for (auto i = 0; i < cellToplogy.size(); ++i)\n    {\n        for (auto jt : cellToplogy[i]) { eind.push_back(jt - 1); }\n        offset += cellToplogy[i].size();\n        eptr[i + 1] = offset;\n    }\n    idx_t nCell = cellToplogy.size();\n    idx_t nNode = bigMesh_->nNode();\n    cellPartition.assign(nCell, 0);\n    nodePartition.assign(nNode, 0);\n    idx_t ncommon = 4;\n    idx_t objval;\n\n    auto rst = METIS_PartMeshDual(&nCell, &nNode, eptr.data(), eind.data(), NULL, NULL, &ncommon, &np, NULL, options, &objval, cellPartition.data(), nodePartition.data());\n\n    nodePartition.clear();\n    vector<idx_t>{}.swap(nodePartition);\n\n    return rst;\n}\n\nint MetisCutter::cut_parmetis(idx_t np, vector<idx_t> &elmdist, vector<idx_t> &eptr, vector<idx_t> &eind, vector<idx_t> &cellPartition)\n{\n    // parallel read element connectivity data\n    idx_t wgtflag = 0;      // 0: no weights(elmwgt is null), 2: weights on the vertices only\n    idx_t numflag = 0;      // 0: C-style numbering, 1: Fortran-style numbering\n    idx_t ncon = 1;         // the number of weights that each vertex has.\n    idx_t ncommonnodes = 2; // should be greater than 0, 2 is ok for most meshes.\n    idx_t edgecut = 0;\n    idx_t opts[3] = {0, 1, static_cast<idx_t>(std::time(nullptr))};\n    real_t tpwgts[ncon * np];\n    real_t ubvec[ncon];\n\n    for (auto i = 0; i < ncon * np; ++i) { tpwgts[i] = 1.0 / (real_t)np; }\n    for (auto i = 0; i < ncon; ++i) { ubvec[i] = 1.05; }\n\n    MPI_Comm mpi_comm = MPI_COMM_WORLD;\n    return ParMETIS_V3_PartMeshKway(elmdist.data(), eptr.data(), eind.data(),\n                                    NULL, // weights of the elements\n                                    &wgtflag, &numflag, &ncon, &ncommonnodes, &np, tpwgts, ubvec, opts, &edgecut, cellPartition.data(), &mpi_comm);\n}\n\nMetisCutter::DecomposeResult MetisCutter::decompose_body(const CGFile::Section &bigBody, const int np)\n{\n    DecomposeResult result;\n\n    auto elmdist = distribute(bigBody.end - bigBody.start + 1, SIZE, result.nCellThisRank);\n    result.start = bigBody.start + elmdist[RANK];\n\n    auto shareBigbody = bigMesh_->loadSection(bigMesh_->bodySectionIdList(), result.start, result.start + result.nCellThisRank - 1);\n\n    std::vector<idx_t> eind, eptr{0};\n    idx_t beg = shareBigbody.isMixed() ? 1 : 0;\n    for (auto id = result.start; id < result.start + result.nCellThisRank; ++id)\n    {\n        auto &tmp = shareBigbody.cell(id);\n        for (int j = beg; j < tmp.size(); ++j) { eind.push_back(tmp[j] - 1); }\n        eptr.push_back(eptr.back() + tmp.size() - beg);\n    }\n    check(true, \"\", format(\"ParMETIS_V3_PartMeshKway begin divide: %s\\n\", shareBigbody.name));\n    cellPartition_.assign(result.nCellThisRank, 0);\n    check(cut_parmetis(np, elmdist, eptr, eind, cellPartition_) == METIS_OK, format(\"Process %d: ParMETIS_V3_PartMeshKway return error while divide section: %s\\n\", RANK, bigBody.name), format(\"ParMETIS_V3_PartMeshKway done\\n\"));\n\n    return result;\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::updateOwnerThread(string bigFileName, const int np)\n{\n    idx_t dummy;\n\n    // calculate partId collection of each thread\n    ownerThread_.assign(np, 0);\n    {\n        auto tmp = distribute(np, SIZE, dummy);\n        for (auto i = 1; i <= SIZE; ++i)\n        {\n            for (auto j = tmp[i - 1]; j < tmp[i]; ++j) ownerThread_[j] = i - 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    smallMesh_.assign(np, nullptr);\n    // for(auto i=0; i<np; ++i)\n    // {\n    //     if(ownerThread[i] == RANK)\n    //     {\n    //         smallMesh_[i] = std::make_shared<CGFile>(smallMeshName(bigFileName, i, np), CG_MODE_WRITE);\n    //         ownerFile_.insert(i);\n    //     }\n    // }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::openSubMeshToWrite(string filename, const int id, const int np)\n{\n    if (ownerThread_[id] == RANK)\n    {\n        smallMesh_[id] = std::make_shared<CGFile>(smallMeshName(filename, id, np), CG_MODE_WRITE);\n        ownerFile_.insert(id);\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::rwBody(const int ifile, const CGFile::Section &bigBody)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[ifile];\n\n    // new a sectionk\n    auto &curS = subFile->addSection();\n    strcpy(curS.name, bigBody.name);\n    curS.cellType = bigBody.cellType;\n    for (auto id : cellIds_) { curS.addCell(id, bigBody.cell(id), bigBody.flag(id)); }\n\n    // write data\n    subFile->writeSection(curS, nodeIdG2L_[ifile]);\n\n    // global info\n    auto len = curS.end - curS.start + 1;\n    subFile->writeGlobalInfo(curS, bigBody.data.size(), globalOffset_, globalOffset_ + len);\n    globalOffset_ += len;\n\n    // update outerface\n    this->updateOuterFace(curS, ifile);\n\n    // clear\n    curS.clear();\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::rwBoundary(const int ifile)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[ifile];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[ifile];\n\n    for (auto ithSection : bigMesh_->bdySectionIdList())\n    {\n        auto &subBdy = subFile->addSection();\n        auto &bigBdy = bigMesh_->loadSection(ithSection);\n        strcpy(subBdy.name, bigBdy.name);\n        subBdy.cellType = bigBdy.cellType;\n\n        cgsize_t ID = bigBdy.start;\n        for (auto i = bigBdy.start; i <= bigBdy.end; ++i)\n        {\n            auto face = bigBdy.cell(i);\n            auto faceStr = CGFile::stringAFace(face);\n            if (curOuterFace.find(faceStr) != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curOuterFace.erase(faceStr);\n                subBdy.addCell(ID++, face, bigBdy.flag(i));\n            }\n        }\n\n        if (!subBdy.data.empty()) subFile->writeSection(subBdy, nodeIdG2L_[ifile]);\n\n        // clear\n        subBdy.clear();\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::rwInterface(const int id)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[id];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[id];\n\n    for (auto nbr = 0; nbr < id; ++nbr)\n    {\n        if (outerFace_[nbr].empty()) continue;\n\n        auto &nbrOuterFace = outerFace_[nbr];\n\n        set<cgsize_t> typeFlags;\n        CGFile::Section curS, nbrS;\n        for (auto face = nbrOuterFace.begin(); face != nbrOuterFace.end();)\n        {\n            auto it = curOuterFace.find(face->first);\n            if (it != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curS.data.emplace_back(it->second);\n                nbrS.data.push_back(face->second);\n\n                auto t = CGFile::CellType(it->second.size(), 2);\n                curS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                nbrS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n\n                typeFlags.insert(it->second.size());\n\n                it = curOuterFace.erase(it);\n                face = nbrOuterFace.erase(face);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                ++face;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!curS.data.empty())\n        {\n            strcpy(curS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", nbr).c_str());\n            strcpy(nbrS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", id).c_str());\n\n            if (typeFlags.size() > 1)\n            {\n                curS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n                nbrS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n                auto curOffset = 0;\n                for (auto it : curS.data)\n                {\n                    curS.offset.push_back(curOffset);\n                    nbrS.offset.push_back(curOffset);\n                    curOffset += it.size() + 1;\n                }\n            }\n            else if (typeFlags.size() == 1)\n            {\n                auto type = (*typeFlags.begin() == 3) ? ElementType_t::TRI_3 : ElementType_t::QUAD_4;\n                curS.cellType = type;\n                nbrS.cellType = type;\n            }\n            subFile->writeSection(curS, nodeIdG2L_[id]);\n            smallMesh_[nbr]->writeSection(nbrS, nodeIdG2L_[nbr]);\n        }\n\n        // clear\n        vector<vector<cgsize_t>>{}.swap(curS.data);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.offset);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.typeFlag);\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::rwNode(const int ifile)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[ifile];\n\n    // zone info\n    subFile->nCell(cellIds_.size());\n    subFile->nNode(nodeIds_.size());\n\n    // node data\n    auto dataTmp = bigMesh_->loadCoordinate(*nodeIds_.begin(), *nodeIds_.rbegin());\n    vector<vector<double>> data(3, vector<double>(nodeIds_.size(), 0.0));\n    auto start = *nodeIds_.begin();\n    cgsize_t i = 0;\n    for (auto id : nodeIds_)\n    {\n        auto loc = id - start;\n        data[0][i] = dataTmp[0][loc];\n        data[1][i] = dataTmp[1][loc];\n        data[2][i] = dataTmp[2][loc];\n        ++i;\n    }\n    smallMesh_[ifile]->writeCoordinate(data);\n}\n\nstd::string MetisCutter::smallMeshName(string bigMeshName, const int id, const int np)\n{\n    char fmt[128], smallFilename[128];\n    // sprintf(fmt, \"%%s.%d.%%0%dd.cgns\", np, int(std::log10(np) + 1));\n    // sprintf(smallFilename, fmt, bigMeshName.substr(0, bigMeshName.size() - 5).c_str(), id);\n    sprintf(fmt, \"decomposed_mesh_%%0%dd.cgns\", int(std::log10(np) + 1));\n    sprintf(smallFilename, fmt, id);\n\n    return smallFilename;\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::updateOuterFace(const CGFile::Section &curS, const int ifile)\n{\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[ifile];\n\n    for (auto i = 0; i < curS.data.size(); ++i)\n    {\n        auto cellType = curS.isMixed() ? CGFile::CellType(curS.typeFlag[i]) : curS.cellType;\n        for (auto it : CGFile::allFaceInCell(curS.data[i], cellType))\n        {\n            auto val = CGFile::stringAFace(it);\n            if (curOuterFace.find(val) != curOuterFace.end()) { curOuterFace.erase(val); }\n            else\n            {\n                curOuterFace.insert({val, it});\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::writeGlobalInfo(const CGFile::Section &curS, const int id)\n{\n    auto len = curS.end - curS.start + 1;\n    smallMesh_[id]->writeGlobalInfo(curS, 10, globalOffset_, globalOffset_ + len);\n    globalOffset_ += len;\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::writeInterface(const int id, const int np)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[id];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[id];\n\n    for (auto nbr = 0; nbr < np; ++nbr)\n    {\n        if (nbr == id) continue;\n        auto nbrIsOwner = ownerFile_.count(nbr) != 0;\n\n        auto &nbrOuterFace = outerFace_[nbr];\n\n        set<cgsize_t> typeFlags;\n        CGFile::Section curS, nbrS;\n        for (auto face = nbrOuterFace.begin(); face != nbrOuterFace.end();)\n        {\n            auto it = curOuterFace.find(face->first);\n            if (it != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curS.data.emplace_back(it->second);\n                auto t = CGFile::CellType(it->second.size(), 2);\n                curS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                typeFlags.insert(it->second.size());\n                it = curOuterFace.erase(it);\n\n                if (nbrIsOwner)\n                {\n                    nbrS.data.push_back(face->second);\n                    nbrS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                    face = nbrOuterFace.erase(face);\n                }\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                ++face;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!curS.data.empty())\n        {\n            strcpy(curS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", nbr).c_str());\n            if (nbrIsOwner) strcpy(nbrS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", id).c_str());\n\n            if (typeFlags.size() > 1)\n            {\n                curS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n                if (nbrIsOwner) nbrS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n            }\n            else if (typeFlags.size() == 1)\n            {\n                auto type = (*typeFlags.begin() == 3) ? ElementType_t::TRI_3 : ElementType_t::QUAD_4;\n                curS.cellType = type;\n                if (nbrIsOwner) nbrS.cellType = type;\n            }\n            subFile->writeSection(curS, nodeIdG2L_[id]);\n            if (nbrIsOwner) smallMesh_[nbr]->writeSection(nbrS, nodeIdG2L_[nbr]);\n        }\n\n        // clear\n        vector<vector<cgsize_t>>{}.swap(curS.data);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.offset);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.typeFlag);\n    }\n}\n\n} // namespace MeshCut\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772611682020}}
{"type":"message","id":"92899b85","parentId":"394b2e4b","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:08:02.026Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-0d06a60660074623962926d9f5cdd18d","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;\n\n\nnamespace MeshCut\n{\nclass MetisCutter : public MeshCutter\n{\npublic:\n    MetisCutter();\n    virtual ~MetisCutter();\n\npublic:\n    void cut(int argc, char** argv) override;\n\nprivate:\n    using cgns_filetype = std::shared_ptr<CGFile>;\n    int RANK = 0, SIZE = 1;\n    cgns_filetype bigMesh_;\n    vector<cgns_filetype> smallMesh_;\n    map<int, map<cgsize_t, cgsize_t>> nodeIdG2L_;\n    set<cgsize_t> nodeIds_, cellIds_;\n    vector<idx_t> cellPartition_, nodePartition_;\n    unordered_map<int, map<string, vector<cgsize_t>>> outerFace_;\n    cgsize_t globalOffset_ = 0;\n    set<int> ownerFile_;\n    struct DecomposeResult\n    {\n        idx_t nCellThisRank, start;\n    };\n    struct Cell\n    {\n        idx_t id;   // begin from 1\n        int partId; // begin from 0;\n    };\n    vector<int> ownerThread_;\n\nprivate:\n    void collect_interface();\n    \n    vector<Cell> collect_subBody(const DecomposeResult& decomposeResult, const vector<int>& ownerThread);\n\n    void cut_metis(string mesh, const int np);\n\n    int cut_metis(const vector<vector<idx_t>>& cellToplogy, idx_t np, vector<idx_t>& cellPartition, vector<idx_t>& nodePartition);\n\n    void cut_parmetis(string mesh, const int np);\n\n    int cut_parmetis(idx_t np, vector<idx_t>& elmdist, vector<idx_t>& eptr, vector<idx_t>& eind, vector<idx_t>& cellPartition);\n\n    DecomposeResult decompose_body(const CGFile::Section& bigBody, const int np);\n\n    void updateOwnerThread(string filename, const int np);\n\n    void openSubMeshToWrite(string filename, const int id, const int np);\n\n    void rwBody(const int ifile, const CGFile::Section& bigBody);\n\n    void rwBoundary(const int ifile);\n\n    void rwInterface(const int ifile);\n\n    void rwNode(const int ifile);\n\n    std::string smallMeshName(string bigMeshName, const int id, const int np);\n\n    void updateOuterFace(const CGFile::Section& curS, const int id);\n\n    void writeGlobalInfo(const CGFile::Section& curS, const int id);\n\n    void writeInterface(const int ifile, const int np);\n};\n} // namespace MeshCut\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772611682025}}
{"type":"message","id":"1b44de6d","parentId":"92899b85","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:08:26.666Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the code structure. Let me implement the P0 fixes:\n\n1. **P0-1: Fix `distribute()` load balancing** (lines 17-24)\n   - Current problem: using ceiling division causes imbalance\n   - Fix: Use floor division + remainder distribution\n\n2. **P0-2: Refactor `collect_interface()` communication** (lines 84-113)\n   - Current problem: MPI_Alltoallv broadcasts to all processes (O(SIZE²))\n   - Fix: Use sparse communication with point-to-point\n\n3. **P1-3: Interface data structure optimization** (if time permits)\n   - Use hash instead of string as key\n\nLet me implement these changes now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I understand the code structure. Let me implement the P0 fixes:\n\n1. **P0-1**: Fix `distribute()` load balancing at L17-24\n2. **P0-2**: Refactor `collect_interface()` to use sparse point-to-point communication\n3. **P1-3**: Optimize interface data structure with hash keys"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-ea9c802979b14e4b94eaba126d46723a","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","newText":"static std::vector<idx_t> distribute(const idx_t len, const int n, idx_t &nCellThisRank)\n{\n    vector<idx_t> dist(n + 1, 0);\n    // P0-1 fix: Use floor division + remainder distribution for better load balancing\n    auto base = len / n;        // Base allocation for each process\n    auto remainder = len % n;   // Remainder to distribute\n    // First 'remainder' processes get base+1, rest get base\n    nCellThisRank = (RANK < remainder) ? base + 1 : base;\n    MPI_Allgather(&nCellThisRank, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), dist.data() + 1, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (int iProc = 1; iProc < n + 1; ++iProc) { dist[iProc] += dist[iProc - 1]; }\n    return dist;\n}","oldText":"static std::vector<idx_t> distribute(const idx_t len, const int n, idx_t &nCellThisRank)\n{\n    vector<idx_t> dist(n + 1, 0);\n    auto step = (len + n - 1) / n;\n    nCellThisRank = MPIAdapter::isLast() ? len - (n - 1) * step : step;\n    MPI_Allgather(&nCellThisRank, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), dist.data() + 1, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (int iProc = 1; iProc < n + 1; ++iProc) { dist[iProc] += dist[iProc - 1]; }\n    return dist;\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":7192,"output":792,"cacheRead":13422,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21406,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772611682026}}
{"type":"message","id":"47d18b74","parentId":"1b44de6d","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:08:26.673Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-ea9c802979b14e4b94eaba126d46723a","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n  16 \n  17 static std::vector<idx_t> distribute(const idx_t len, const int n, idx_t &nCellThisRank)\n  18 {\n  19     vector<idx_t> dist(n + 1, 0);\n- 20     auto step = (len + n - 1) / n;\n- 21     nCellThisRank = MPIAdapter::isLast() ? len - (n - 1) * step : step;\n+ 20     // P0-1 fix: Use floor division + remainder distribution for better load balancing\n+ 21     auto base = len / n;        // Base allocation for each process\n+ 22     auto remainder = len % n;   // Remainder to distribute\n+ 23     // First 'remainder' processes get base+1, rest get base\n+ 24     nCellThisRank = (RANK < remainder) ? base + 1 : base;\n  22     MPI_Allgather(&nCellThisRank, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), dist.data() + 1, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n  23     for (int iProc = 1; iProc < n + 1; ++iProc) { dist[iProc] += dist[iProc - 1]; }\n  24     return dist;\n  25 }\n     ...","firstChangedLine":20},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772611706671}}
{"type":"message","id":"bb869fd7","parentId":"47d18b74","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:09:43.228Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, P0-1 is fixed. Now let me fix P0-2 - the collect_interface() function. This needs to use sparse point-to-point communication instead of MPI_Alltoallv.\n\nLet me analyze the current collect_interface():\n1. It packs interface data into a string\n2. Uses MPI_Alltoallv to broadcast to ALL processes (O(SIZE²) communication)\n3. Unpacks the received data\n\nThe optimized version should:\n1. Identify which processes actually need communication (based on outerFace_ and ownerThread_)\n2. Use point-to-point MPI_Isend/MPI_Irecv instead of Alltoallv\n3. Use binary serialization instead of string serialization\n\nLet me also check the outerFace_ data structure. It's:\n```cpp\nunordered_map<int, map<string, vector<cgsize_t>>> outerFace_;\n```\nWhere:\n- Key: file/partition index\n- Value: map of face string -> face node IDs\n\nFor P0-2, I need to:\n1. Determine target ranks (processes that own partitions we share interfaces with)\n2. Exchange data only with those target ranks\n3. Use binary serialization\n\nFor binary serialization, I need to pack:\n- Number of files\n- For each file:\n  - File ID\n  - Number of faces\n  - For each face: the face node IDs\n\nLet me write the optimized collect_interface function.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me implement P0-2 - the sparse communication for `collect_interface()`:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-ba843ed5e135429c90fd5936c354be30","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","newText":"// collect interface from all other threads\n// P0-2: Optimized with sparse point-to-point communication and binary serialization\nvoid MetisCutter::collect_interface()\n{\n    // 1. Identify target ranks (processes we need to communicate with)\n    std::set<int> targetRanks;\n    for (const auto& [nbrFile, faces] : outerFace_)\n    {\n        if (!faces.empty() && ownerThread_.size() > static_cast<size_t>(nbrFile))\n        {\n            int ownerRank = ownerThread_[nbrFile];\n            if (ownerRank != RANK)\n                targetRanks.insert(ownerRank);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 2. Exchange target rank lists using Allgather (small data, O(SIZE) cost)\n    vector<int> myTargets(targetRanks.begin(), targetRanks.end());\n    int myTargetCount = static_cast<int>(myTargets.size());\n    vector<int> allTargetCounts(SIZE, 0);\n    MPI_Allgather(&myTargetCount, 1, MPI_INT, allTargetCounts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    // Calculate displacements for Allgatherv\n    vector<int> targetDisps(SIZE, 0);\n    int totalTargets = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i)\n    {\n        targetDisps[i] = totalTargets;\n        totalTargets += allTargetCounts[i];\n    }\n\n    // Gather all target ranks\n    vector<int> allTargets(totalTargets, 0);\n    MPI_Allgatherv(myTargets.data(), myTargetCount, MPI_INT,\n                   allTargets.data(), allTargetCounts.data(), targetDisps.data(), MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    // 3. Build list of source ranks (ranks that will send to us)\n    std::set<int> sourceRanks;\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i)\n    {\n        if (i == RANK) continue;\n        int start = targetDisps[i];\n        int end = start + allTargetCounts[i];\n        for (int j = start; j < end; ++j)\n        {\n            if (allTargets[j] == RANK)\n            {\n                sourceRanks.insert(i);\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 4. Binary serialization of interface data\n    auto packInterfaceBinary = [&, this]() -> std::vector<char>\n    {\n        std::vector<char> buffer;\n        \n        // Count files with data\n        int fileCount = 0;\n        for (const auto& [nbrFile, faces] : outerFace_)\n        {\n            if (!faces.empty() && ownerThread_.size() > static_cast<size_t>(nbrFile) && ownerThread_[nbrFile] != RANK)\n                ++fileCount;\n        }\n        \n        // Write file count\n        size_t pos = 0;\n        buffer.resize(sizeof(int));\n        std::memcpy(buffer.data(), &fileCount, sizeof(int));\n        pos = sizeof(int);\n        \n        for (const auto& [nbrFile, faces] : outerFace_)\n        {\n            if (faces.empty()) continue;\n            if (ownerThread_.size() <= static_cast<size_t>(nbrFile)) continue;\n            if (ownerThread_[nbrFile] == RANK) continue;  // Skip own files\n            \n            // Write file ID\n            size_t needed = pos + sizeof(int) + sizeof(int);\n            if (buffer.size() < needed) buffer.resize(needed);\n            int fid = nbrFile;\n            std::memcpy(buffer.data() + pos, &fid, sizeof(int));\n            pos += sizeof(int);\n            \n            // Write face count\n            int faceCount = static_cast<int>(faces.size());\n            std::memcpy(buffer.data() + pos, &faceCount, sizeof(int));\n            pos += sizeof(int);\n            \n            // Write each face (string key only, we don't need the node IDs for interface matching)\n            for (const auto& [faceStr, _] : faces)\n            {\n                int strLen = static_cast<int>(faceStr.size());\n                needed = pos + sizeof(int) + strLen;\n                if (buffer.size() < needed) buffer.resize(needed);\n                std::memcpy(buffer.data() + pos, &strLen, sizeof(int));\n                pos += sizeof(int);\n                std::memcpy(buffer.data() + pos, faceStr.data(), strLen);\n                pos += strLen;\n            }\n        }\n        buffer.resize(pos);\n        return buffer;\n    };\n\n    auto unpackInterfaceBinary = [&, this](const std::vector<char>& buffer)\n    {\n        if (buffer.empty()) return;\n        \n        size_t pos = 0;\n        int fileCount;\n        std::memcpy(&fileCount, buffer.data(), sizeof(int));\n        pos = sizeof(int);\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < fileCount; ++i)\n        {\n            // Read file ID\n            int nbrFile;\n            std::memcpy(&nbrFile, buffer.data() + pos, sizeof(int));\n            pos += sizeof(int);\n            \n            // Read face count\n            int faceCount;\n            std::memcpy(&faceCount, buffer.data() + pos, sizeof(int));\n            pos += sizeof(int);\n            \n            if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) continue;\n            \n            check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %d interface of file %d\\n\", RANK, faceCount, nbrFile));\n            \n            auto& nbrOuterFace = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n            for (int j = 0; j < faceCount; ++j)\n            {\n                // Read string length\n                int strLen;\n                std::memcpy(&strLen, buffer.data() + pos, sizeof(int));\n                pos += sizeof(int);\n                \n                // Read face string\n                std::string faceStr(buffer.data() + pos, strLen);\n                pos += strLen;\n                \n                nbrOuterFace.insert({faceStr, {}});\n            }\n        }\n    };\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    // 5. Point-to-point communication using non-blocking send/recv\n    std::vector<MPI_Request> requests;\n    std::vector<std::vector<char>> sendBuffers;\n    std::vector<std::vector<char>> recvBuffers(sourceRanks.size());\n    \n    // Pack data once for all targets\n    auto packedData = packInterfaceBinary();\n    \n    // Post receives first\n    int recvIdx = 0;\n    for (int src : sourceRanks)\n    {\n        requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n        recvBuffers[recvIdx].resize(1024 * 1024);  // Initial buffer size, will use probe for actual size\n        MPI_Irecv(recvBuffers[recvIdx].data(), static_cast<int>(recvBuffers[recvIdx].size()), MPI_CHAR,\n                  src, DataTAG + RANK, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        ++recvIdx;\n    }\n    \n    // Send data to each target rank\n    for (int target : targetRanks)\n    {\n        sendBuffers.push_back(packedData);\n        requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n        MPI_Isend(sendBuffers.back().data(), static_cast<int>(sendBuffers.back().size()), MPI_CHAR,\n                  target, DataTAG + target, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n    }\n    \n    // Wait for all communications to complete\n    std::vector<MPI_Status> statuses(requests.size());\n    MPI_Waitall(static_cast<int>(requests.size()), requests.data(), statuses.data());\n    \n    // 6. Unpack received data\n    recvIdx = 0;\n    for (size_t i = 0; i < sourceRanks.size(); ++i)\n    {\n        // Get actual received size\n        int actualSize;\n        MPI_Get_count(&statuses[i], MPI_CHAR, &actualSize);\n        recvBuffers[i].resize(actualSize);\n        unpackInterfaceBinary(recvBuffers[i]);\n    }\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n}","oldText":"// collect interface from all other threads\nvoid MetisCutter::collect_interface()\n{\n    auto packInterface = [&, this]() -> std::string\n    {\n        std::string sendStr;\n        for (auto ifile : outerFace_)\n        {\n            if (ifile.second.empty()) continue;\n\n            sendStr += (std::to_string(ifile.first) + \":\");\n            for (auto face : ifile.second) { sendStr += (face.first + \";\"); }\n            sendStr += \"#\";\n        }\n\n        return sendStr;\n    };\n\n    auto unpackInterface = [&, this](const string &recvStr)\n    {\n        for (auto ifile : stringSplit(recvStr, \"#\"))\n        {\n            auto cur = stringSplit(ifile, \":\");\n            auto nbrFile = std::stoi(cur[0]);\n            if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) continue;\n\n            check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %d interface of file %d\\n\", RANK, stringSplit(cur[1], \";\").size(), nbrFile));\n\n            auto &nbrOuterface = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n            for (auto face : stringSplit(cur[1], \";\")) { nbrOuterface.insert({face, {}}); }\n        }\n    };\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    string sendTmp = packInterface(), recvStr, sendStr;\n    int sendCnt = sendTmp.size();\n    vector<int> sendCnts(SIZE, sendCnt), sdisp(SIZE, 0), rdisp(SIZE, 0), recvCnt(SIZE, 0);\n\n    MPI_Alltoall(sendCnts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, recvCnt.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (auto i = 1; i < SIZE; ++i) rdisp[i] = rdisp[i - 1] + recvCnt[i - 1];\n    recvStr.assign(std::accumulate(recvCnt.begin(), recvCnt.end(), 0) + 1, ' ');\n    for (auto i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) sendStr += sendTmp;\n    for (auto i = 1; i < SIZE; ++i) sdisp[i] = sdisp[i - 1] + sendCnt;\n    MPI_Alltoallv(sendStr.data(), sendCnts.data(), sdisp.data(), MPI_CHAR, (char *)(recvStr.data()), recvCnt.data(), rdisp.data(), MPI_CHAR, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n    unpackInterface(stringTrim(recvStr));\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":518,"output":2846,"cacheRead":20612,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23976,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772611706673}}
