{"type":"message","id":"e578c493","parentId":"12c0ffd4","timestamp":"2026-03-04T08:17:08.399Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `distribute` function is a static function that doesn't have access to the class member `RANK`. I need to pass RANK as a parameter or use MPI_Comm_rank directly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I need to fix the `distribute` function - it's a static function without access to the class member `RANK`:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-be52dc7cc12f4577bbd8ca485ea3caef","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","newText":"static std::vector<idx_t> distribute(const idx_t len, const int n, idx_t &nCellThisRank)\n{\n    vector<idx_t> dist(n + 1, 0);\n    // P0-1 fix: Use floor division + remainder distribution for better load balancing\n    auto base = len / n;        // Base allocation for each process\n    auto remainder = len % n;   // Remainder to distribute\n    // Get current rank for load balancing decision\n    int currentRank;\n    MPI_Comm_rank(MPI_COMM_WORLD, &currentRank);\n    // First 'remainder' processes get base+1, rest get base\n    nCellThisRank = (currentRank < remainder) ? base + 1 : base;\n    MPI_Allgather(&nCellThisRank, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), dist.data() + 1, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (int iProc = 1; iProc < n + 1; ++iProc) { dist[iProc] += dist[iProc - 1]; }\n    return dist;\n}","oldText":"static std::vector<idx_t> distribute(const idx_t len, const int n, idx_t &nCellThisRank)\n{\n    vector<idx_t> dist(n + 1, 0);\n    // P0-1 fix: Use floor division + remainder distribution for better load balancing\n    auto base = len / n;        // Base allocation for each process\n    auto remainder = len % n;   // Remainder to distribute\n    // First 'remainder' processes get base+1, rest get base\n    nCellThisRank = (RANK < remainder) ? base + 1 : base;\n    MPI_Allgather(&nCellThisRank, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), dist.data() + 1, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (int iProc = 1; iProc < n + 1; ++iProc) { dist[iProc] += dist[iProc - 1]; }\n    return dist;\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":2158,"output":594,"cacheRead":36543,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39295,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772612196282}}
